#, python-format
msgid "String could not be propagated to %d component."
msgid_plural "String could not be propagated to %d components."
msgstr[0] "ຂໍ້ຄວາມບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຍັງ %d ສ່ວນປະກອບ."

msgid "Unmark as read-only"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍເປັນອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ"

